    {
      "tr": "`for item in stream:` içinde `for row in range(depth): table[row][h(item, row) % width] += 1`.",
      "en": "Inside `for item in stream:`, `for row in range(depth): table[row][h(item, row) % width] += 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Tahmin: `min(table[row][h(q, row) % width] for row in range(depth))`.",
      "en": "Estimate: `min(table[row][h(q, row) % width] for row in range(depth))`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport math\n\n\ndef h(item, seed):\n    data = f\"{seed}:{item}\".encode()\n    return int.from_bytes(hashlib.blake2b(data, digest_size=8).digest(), \"big\")\n\n\ndef cm_estimates(stream, queries, width, depth):\n    table = [[0] * width for _ in range(depth)]\n    for item in stream:\n        for row in range(depth):\n            table[row][h(item, row) % width] += 1\n    return [min(table[row][h(q, row) % width] for row in range(depth)) for q in queries]\n\nstream = [\"a\"] * 50 + [\"b\"] * 20 + [f\"x{i}\" for i in range(100)]\nprint(cm_estimates(stream, [\"a\", \"b\", \"x3\", \"zzz\"], 16, 3))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport math\n\n\ndef h(item, seed):\n    data = f\"{seed}:{item}\".encode()\n    return int.from_bytes(hashlib.blake2b(data, digest_size=8).digest(), \"big\")\n\n\ndef cm_estimates(stream, queries, width, depth):\n    table = [[0] * width for _ in range(depth)]\n    for item in stream:\n        for row in range(depth):\n            table[row][h(item, row) % width] += 1\n    return [min(table[row][h(q, row) % width] for row in range(depth)) for q in queries]\n\nstream = [\"a\"] * 50 + [\"b\"] * 20 + [f\"x{i}\" for i in range(100)]\nprint(cm_estimates(stream, [\"a\", \"b\", \"x3\", \"zzz\"], 16, 3))\n```"
    }
  ],
